{
  "info": {
    "name": "USM Messenger API",
    "_postman_id": "a7b3c4d5-6e7f-4890-9012-3456789abcde",
    "description": "Полная коллекция REST-эндпоинтов USM Messenger.\n\n## Установка\n\n1. Импортируй файл в Postman (File → Import).\n2. Запусти бэкенд: `docker compose up -d` (или локально через `mvn spring-boot:run`).\n3. **Важно (HTTPS / self-signed):** Postman → Settings → General → выключить **SSL certificate verification**.\n4. Открой запрос **Auth → Login** и выполни — токен автоматически сохранится в переменную `{{token}}`.\n5. Остальные запросы готовы к использованию.\n\n## Тестовые пользователи (seed из V2 миграции)\n\nПароль для всех: `Demo123!`\n\n| Login (email или ИДНП) | Роль |\n|---|---|\n| `admin@usm.md` или `2001123456789` | ADMIN |\n| `ana.popescu@usm.md` или `2002987654321` | STUDENT |\n| `ion.munteanu@usm.md` или `2003111222333` | STUDENT |\n| `victor.ceban@usm.md` или `1990555666777` | TEACHER |\n\n## Переменные коллекции\n\n- `baseUrl` — `https://localhost:8443`\n- `token` — JWT (заполняется автоматически после Login)\n- `chatId`, `userId`, `fileId`, `attachmentId` — для удобства подставляются в пути",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://localhost:8443", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "chatId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "fileId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "attachmentId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ping",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/ping", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "ping"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "health"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res && res.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.token);",
                  "  console.log('Saved token, expires at: ' + new Date(res.expiresAtEpochMs).toISOString());",
                  "  if (res.user && res.user.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(res.user.id));",
                  "  }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('token present', () => pm.expect(res.token).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"admin@usm.md\",\n  \"password\": \"Demo123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Поле `login` принимает либо email (содержит `@`), либо ИДНП. Ответ кладёт JWT в `{{token}}`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (student)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"ana.popescu@usm.md\",\n  \"password\": \"Demo123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login by IDNP",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"2001123456789\",\n  \"password\": \"Demo123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get current user (me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Admin\",\n  \"lastName\": \"USM\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@usm.md\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"Demo123!\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NewPass123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "me", "password"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Set my avatar",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/avatar?fileId={{fileId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "me", "avatar"],
              "query": [{ "key": "fileId", "value": "{{fileId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "fileId — id из MongoDB, возвращённый POST /api/files/avatars/user."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List all users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get user by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "{{userId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/search?q=ana",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "search"],
              "query": [{ "key": "q", "value": "ana" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Chats",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List my chats",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chats", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chats"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create chat",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (r && r.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('chatId', String(r.id)); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Тестовый чат\",\n  \"type\": \"GROUP\",\n  \"description\": \"Создан через Postman\",\n  \"memberIds\": [2, 3]\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chats", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chats"] },
            "description": "type: GROUP, DIRECT или CHANNEL. Создатель добавляется автоматически."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get chat by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chats", "{{chatId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update chat",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Новое название\",\n  \"description\": \"Обновлённое описание\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chats", "{{chatId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete chat",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chats", "{{chatId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Chat members",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/members", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chats", "{{chatId}}", "members"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add member",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/members/{{userId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chats", "{{chatId}}", "members", "{{userId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove member",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/members/{{userId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chats", "{{chatId}}", "members", "{{userId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Pin chat",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"pinned\": true }" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/pin", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chats", "{{chatId}}", "pin"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mute chat",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"muted\": true }" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/mute", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chats", "{{chatId}}", "mute"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Set chat avatar",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/avatar?fileId={{fileId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "chats", "{{chatId}}", "avatar"],
